#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:5
msgid "Edit nomenclature"
msgstr "编辑名称"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:7
msgid ""
"The nomenclature properties can only be displayed from `selection properties"
" panel`_ once the summary table has been selected at `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"术语属性只能从 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ "
"选择简表后显示。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech nomenclature properties panel, display tab"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 术语属性面板，显示标签"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:17
msgid ""
"If the `selection properties panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed "
"from **Settings > Display > Selection properties**."
msgstr ""
"如果不显示 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 选择属性** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:20
msgid "Nomenclature geometry and line"
msgstr "名词几何和线条"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:25
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech summary geometry and lines properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech摘要几何和线条属性"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:27
msgid ""
"The **Geometry and lines** section from the summary properties allows "
"defining:"
msgstr "**图形和线条** 部分从摘要属性中可以定义："

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:29
msgid ""
"Nomenclature table position (coordinates **X** and **Y**) in the `folio`_."
msgstr "字母表位置(坐标 **X** 和 **Y**)在 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 中。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:30
msgid "Maximum number of table rows."
msgstr "最大表行数 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:31
msgid ""
"Adjust the size of the table to the `folio`_, automatic margin definition."
msgstr "将表格的大小调整到 `图幅 <folio_>`_，自动比值定义。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:32
msgid ""
"Define previous nomenclature table, property to be used if the nomenclature "
"table is not fitting in one `folio`_."
msgstr "定义上一个名称表，如果名称表不匹配于一个 `图幅 <folio_>`_，则使用属性。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:36
msgid ""
"If the table is not fitting in one `folio`_, each nomenclature table has to "
"have a **Table name** defined. Without **Table name**, the link between "
"tables cannot be defined."
msgstr ""
"如果该表不匹配一个 `图幅 <folio_>`_，则每个术语表必须有一个 **表格名称** 的定义。如果没有 "
"**表格名称**,则无法定义表格之间的联系。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:40
msgid "Header"
msgstr "页眉"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:45
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech nomenclature header properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 术语标题属性"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:47
msgid ""
"The **Header** section from the nomenclature properties allows defining:"
msgstr "术语属性中的 **页眉** 节允许定义："

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:49
msgid "Top, bottom, left and right margin in the header cells."
msgstr "头部单元格的上，下，左右边距。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:50
msgid "Text alignment in the header cells."
msgstr "标题单元格中的文本对齐。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:51
msgid "Text font of the table header."
msgstr "表格头的文字字体。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:56
#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:75
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech nomenclature table text font"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 术语表文本字体"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:59
msgid "Table"
msgstr "图表"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:64
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech nomenclature table properties panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech术语表属性面板"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:66
msgid ""
"The **Table** section from the nomenclature properties allows defining:"
msgstr "术语属性中的 **表** 节允许定义："

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:68
msgid "Top, bottom, left and right margin in the table cells."
msgstr "表格单元格的上，下，左右边距。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:69
msgid "Text alignment in the table cells."
msgstr "表格单元格中的文本对齐。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:70
msgid "Text font of the table."
msgstr "表格的文字字体。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:78
msgid "Content request"
msgstr "内容请求"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:80
msgid ""
"The `element properties`_ to be displayed at the nomenclature table, the "
"columns information, can be modified and re-organized at any time."
msgstr "`元素属性 <element properties_>`_ 在名称表显示，列信息，可以随时修改和重新组织。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:83
msgid "To modify the content request from nomenclature:"
msgstr "修改术语中的内容要求："

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:85
msgid ""
"`Select`_ one of the tables from the nomenclature to display the "
"nomenclature properties at `selection properties panel`_."
msgstr ""
"`从名词中选择 <Select_>`_，在 `选定属性面板上显示名词属性 <selection properties panel_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:86
msgid "Go to **Content** tab."
msgstr "转到 **Content** 标签 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:91
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech nomenclature properties panel, content tab"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 术语属性面板，内容标签"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:93
msgid ""
"Click **Request** button to display the content configuration PopUp window."
msgstr "点击 **请求** 按钮显示内容配置 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:94
msgid ""
"Modify the list of information to be displayed by the commands of the "
"following table."
msgstr "修改下表命令要显示的信息列表。"

